"""aka — protocol tokens that live under several names.

A wire token is a quoted string, YAML/JSON key, or flag. Identifiers that
inflect the same way (has_more / hasMore / HAS_MORE) are the same token.
`aka` lists those identities and, given a patch, reports one-sided edits.
"""

